sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant Server
    Client->>Server: TCP control connection to port 21
    Client->>Server: USER / PASS / PASV / RETR or STOR
    Server-->>Client: Reply on control channel
    Client->>Server: TCP data connection in passive mode
    Server-->>Client: File bytes or directory listing on data channel
    Note over Client,Server: Classic FTP sends credentials and content without TLS by default